// --- 74LS295B  4-bit shift register, 3-state outputs -------------- К555ИР16 --
//   1=SER 2..5=A..D  6=MODE (1 = parallel load)  8=OE (1 = outputs driven)
//   9=CLK (falling edge)  13,12,11,10 = QA..QD
